  "description": {
   "value": "<p>Beginning at 13th level, your shikigami grows stronger. Your companion gains the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You can spread out 4 points among its ability scores (max of 20).  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Its strike attacks deal 1d6 extra necrotic damage(total of 2d6).  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can either choose for your shikigami to become large, or gain the ability to become any weapon, dealing an additional 2d6 necrotic damage.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
